  "releaseNotes": "1.0.17 - Add more detail to HTTP request logger.\n\t\t\t1.0.16 - Rebuild with updated interfaces.\n\t\t\t1.0.15 - Rebuild with date/time extension methods for Unix epoch conversions.\n\t\t\t1.0.14 - Rebuild with Unix epoch extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.13 - Rebuild with geographic coordinate obfuscation.\n\t\t\t1.0.12 - Rebuild with default timestamp for service result.\n\t\t\t1.0.11 - Add method to get time zone offset for locale and date.\n\t\t\t1.0.10 - Rebuild with enum extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.9 - Rebuild with type for geographic coordinates.\n\t\t\t1.0.8 - Rebuild with optional leading/trailing whitespace in key-value pair lookup.\n\t\t\t1.0.7 - Rebuild with updated package dependencies.\n\t\t\t1.0.6 - Rebuild with new metadata method.\n\t\t\t1.0.5 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum.\n\t\t\t1.0.4 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum.\n\t\t\t1.0.3 - Rebuild with updated interface for string conversion methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.2 - Initial revision, targetting .NET 8",
